OL,3,GNEWSAKey footbridge set to remain shut
OL,4,Auntil spring
OL,5,
OL,6,FA footbridge connecting a residential
OL,7,Farea with a primary school may not
OL,8,Freopen until spring after it was closed
OL,9,Fover safety concerns.
OL,11,FOxfordshire County Council shut the
OL,12,Fnarrow Swan Street footbridge, which
OL,13,Fconnects Osney Island with Ferry
OL,14,FHinksey Road in Oxford, last month.
OL,16,FThe local authority said its inspectors
OL,17,Fhad "identified safety concerns with
OL,18,Fthe structure", initially telling
OL,19,Fresidents that it could be closed for
OL,20,Fup to four years before adjusting that
OL,21,Ftime frame to spring 2027.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,340,330,200,160,0,100
