OL,3,GNEWSAKey footbridge set to remain shut
OL,4,Auntil spring
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe bridge is widely used by children
OL,7,Fand parents at West Oxford Primary
OL,8,FSchool, with local resident Simon
OL,9,FCollings saying "a fair bit of
OL,10,Ffrustration built up" regarding the
OL,11,Fclosure.
